<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ ADRs mixed in New York as Dow gains 49.</title>
<headline>NZ ADRs mixed in New York as Dow gains 49.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mixed in New York, while the Dow Jones Index was up 49.77 in late trade.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S., Britain and Australia.</p>
<p>Company	Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$28 1/8	 nil    *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$28 3/4	 +0 1/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	N.Y.    US$21 1/4	 +0 3/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$13 1/8	 +0 1/8 *</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$35 5/8	 -0 1/8 *</p>
<p>Tranz Rail     N.Y.    US$17 5/8	 -0 1/4 *</p>
<p>Thistle	  London  169 p</p>
<p>Guinness Peat  London  38 1/2		+1</p>
<p>NZ IT	    London  untraded</p>
<p>Foreign &amp; Col  London  12 1/2 Templeton	London  144 3/4</p>
<p>Lion	     Sydney  A$3.03	    -0.08</p>
<p>Goodman	  Sydney  A$1.66	    -0.02</p>
<p>Macraes	  Sydney  A$2.23</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of eight shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
